harness  a coding agent in your terminal                                        
                                                                                
  model  gpt-test                                                               
  cwd    /work/proj                                                             
                                                                                
  / for commands   @ for files   ! for the shell                                
                                                                                
  tip: ctrl+o expands the tool calls of the transcript                          
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
 gpt-test · idle  ctrl+o expands tools · ctrl+c quits                           
│ Message (enter sends, alt+enter or ctrl+j adds a line)                        
